WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.460
At almost 16, a boy in Roman Britain was
captured by raiders and carried across

2
00:00:05.510 --> 00:00:07.210
the sea to Ireland.

3
00:00:07.260 --> 00:00:10.770
For six years he herded flocks as a slave.

4
00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:14.000
Then he fled about 200 miles to the coast,

5
00:00:14.050 --> 00:00:16.630
found a ship, and escaped home.

6
00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:20.780
Years later, he went back to the
very land that had enslaved him.

7
00:00:20.830 --> 00:00:22.900
Why would anyone do that?

8
00:00:22.950 --> 00:00:26.520
In this mission, you'll read
the only two writings he left:

9
00:00:26.570 --> 00:00:29.820
a confession, and a furious open letter.

10
00:00:29.870 --> 00:00:34.660
Then you'll test the famous later legends
against what Patrick actually wrote.

11
00:00:34.710 --> 00:00:38.920
Your mission: find out what
Patrick's own words reveal about him.
